function* combos(n,prefix=''){ if(n===0){yield prefix;return} for(const p of parts){yield* combos(n-1,prefix+p)} }
let lostPrerelease=[],lostBuild=[],lostMatch=[],gained=[]
for(let n=1;n<=5;n++){
  for(const s of combos(n)){
    const a=coerceWith(baseSrc,s)
    const b=coerceWith(newSrc,s)
    if(a===b) continue
    if(b===null){lostMatch.push([s,a,b]);continue}
    if(!a){gained.push([s,a,b]);continue}
    const aHasPre=a.includes('-'), bHasPre=b.includes('-')
    const aHasBld=a.includes('+'), bHasBld=b.includes('+')
    if(aHasPre&&!bHasPre) lostPrerelease.push([s,a,b])
    else if(aHasBld&&!bHasBld) lostBuild.push([s,a,b])
    else if(bHasPre&&!aHasPre) gained.push([s,a,b])
    else lostPrerelease.push(['OTHER',s,a,b])
  }
}
